  "copyright": "PUBLIC DOMAIN",
  "verseCount": 22,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "4",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "2TI 4"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "4",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TI 4:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nalīkūkomeleja kū būtongi bo ng'wa Mulungu na bo ng'wa Kilisito Yesu, ūyo akūbalamula pye a banhū, a bapanga na a bafu, ū ng'wikanza lya kwilonga kwakwe mu būtemi bokwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.4.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.4.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TI 4:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gūlomeelage ū mhayo, bizaga ūmalīīlile būlī ikanza, lībize ūlīhelile nūūlū īlo ūtalīhelile; hamaga, hūgūlaga, ganikīlaga mu wiyūmīlīja na kalangīle kose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.4.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.4.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TI 4:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno līkūshika ikanza bakoya ū kūdegeleka a malange a masoga, bakūyikala bakwalīlījaga balangi ba būlī mbika, ba kūyūbabaabaata ū kū matū na mihayo ya kūlenganīla na kwikūmva kwabo! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.4.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.4.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TI 4:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nīyo bakūgasaamya a matū gabo ū kū ya ng'hana, bagagalūche gabize ga kūdegelekela sūūsū dūhū! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.4.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.4.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TI 4:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ū bebe bizaga na masala madeekanu mu būlī mhayo; ūbize ng'wiyūmīlīja nūūlū mu makoye; gūtūmamage ū nīmo gwa kūjilomeela ī Ng'hūlū Jawiza, ūgūshikīlīje ū nīmo gwako.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.4.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.4.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Paulo kūsomboola mihayo yakwe",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TI 4:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.4.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.4.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TI 4:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno ū nene naamalile kūfunyiwa gītī shitambo, ī likanza lya kwīnga kwane lyashikaga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.4.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.4.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TI 4:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naabūlwishije chiza ū būlūgū mu kūkūlang'hana ū kūzunya, naalūkalīchaga ū lūdīīma lwane. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.4.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.4.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TI 4:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū kū ng'halīlo ya yose ū mu lūshikū lwenūlo, īlīho mheela ya būtūngīlīja, īyo natūūlīlilwe; ngikili ya nyatemi, īyo akūninha ū Seeba, ū Namuji ntūngīlīja. Hangī nīyo ītī nene dūhū, alīyo pye na a bangī abo bakūyegelile ū kwilonga kwakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.4.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.4.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TI 4:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ītaga wize ū kūūnū wangū, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.4.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.4.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TI 4:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nguno ū Dema wanilekile, watogilwe ya mu sī, wajile Tesalonike. Ū Kulesite wajile Galatia, ū Tito nang'hwe Dalimatia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.4.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.4.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TI 4:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Luka dūhū h'ūyo alī hamò nane. Ūlū ūlabūūke kwiza ng'wizanage nū Maliko, nguno akūnigunanha hataale ū mu nīmo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.4.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.4.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TI 4:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Tikiko nantūmile Efeso. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.4.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.4.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TI 4:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī kabbuudi ya mbeho īyo nakīleka Tiloa ha ng'wa Kalipo yenhanījage ūlū ūliza, pyī nī shitabo, ī no no no ī sha ndīlī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.4.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.4.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TI 4:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Isikanda ū nsuji wa chūma wanīītīla mihayo mingī ī yabūbi, ū Seeba akūng'winha mheela ya kwigeleelwa shītwa shakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.4.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.4.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TI 4:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nū bebe nkangūkage, nguno a bise watwihalalījaga kībi no īyo twīhayaga! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.4.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.4.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TI 4:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A ha būsombooji wa kwandya ū ng'wikanza lya būbūūlwa bone, atigelile nūūlū ūmò wa kwīmīīla hamò nane, pye bakanileka; ū Seeba ni atizagūbabalīla būbi ū mu mhayo gwenūyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.4.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.4.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TI 4:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwike ū Seeba akīmīīla hamò nane ūniguzuhya, kūlwa gīkī ū būlomeeji wa Ng'hūlū Jawiza būshikīlījiwe kūbītīla mulī nene, pye a banhū ba mahanga bigwe, h'ī chene nakapījiwa kūfuma ū mu nomo gwa shimba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.4.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.4.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TI 4:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nīyo ū Seeba akongeja ū kūnipīja kūfuma mu būlī nīmo gwabūbi, na akūnishisha mhola ū mu būtemi bokwe ū bo ng'wigūlū. Ikūjo lībize kūlī we shiku jose: Alichene.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.4.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.4.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Būgīsha bo kūmalīja",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TI 4:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.4.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.4.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TI 4:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngīshage ū Piliska nū Akula, hamò nī kaya ya ng'wa Onesifolo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.4.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.4.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TI 4:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Elasto akasaaga Kolinto, alīyo ū Tulofimo ū ng'wene akasaata nūneka Mileto. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.4.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.4.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TI 4:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Angūhaga ū kwiza kūko ī mbeho ya mu shiyaga ītaalī kwandya. Alīkūgīsha ū Eubulo nū Pude, nū Lino, nū Kilaudio, pye na a badūgū a bangī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.4.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.4.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TI 4:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Seeba abize hamò na moyo gwako. Shigongo shibize hamò nang'ho: Alichene.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.4.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.4.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
